[CR CR0168 for 38.212] Reason for change: Capture the agreed TPs and agreements from RAN1#114bis meeting and RAN1#115 meeting. Reflect the agreement on FDRA when ScheduledCellCombo-ListDCI-0-3 is not configured from RAN1#114bis meeting. Reflect the agreement on the minimum applicable scheduling offset indicator in DCI format 0_3/1_3 from RAN1#114bis meeting. Reflect the agreements on the SCell dormancy indication in DCI format 0_3/1_3 from RAN1#114bis meeting and RAN1#115 meeting. Reflect the agreement on TDRA from RAN1#114bis meeting. Reflect the agreement on BWP indicator from RAN1#115 meeting. Reflect the agreement on DCI size determination from RAN1#115 meeting. Summary of change: Add the clarification to FDRA field for DCI format 0_3 that all '0's for FDRA Type 2 with μ=1 or all ‘1’s for FDRA Type 2 with μ=0 indicates the corresponding cell is not scheduled. Update the description for the minimum applicable scheduling offset indicator when the bit size is equal to 1. Update the description for SCell dormancy indication in DCI format 0_3 and DCI format 1_3. Update the description for TDRA in DCI format 0_3 and DCI format 1_3 to reflect that entries of the joint table for TDRA (i.e., TDRA-FieldIndexDCI-1-3) are configured for each BWP of each CC. Update the description for BWP indicator field in DCI format 0_3/1_3. Add description on DCI size determination if an SCell within the set of cells is deactivated or dormant. Consequences if not approved: The specification for Rel-18 Multi-carrier enhancements is incomplete.

